{#-
  ════════ RETIREMENT FAMILY STRIP ════════

  The four questions of the retirement decision funnel, in order, with the
  current page marked. Rendered on all four family pages and on the hub.

  WHY THE STYLES LIVE IN THE COMPONENT. Page CSS on this site is a per-page
  include, so styling this strip the usual way would mean editing four
  stylesheets to add one shared component — and the batch this shipped in
  permitted exactly one change to each existing family page. Carrying its own
  scoped `<style>` keeps the per-page edit to a single include line, which is
  also what makes the strip safe to add to a fifth page later. Every selector
  is prefixed `rfam-`; every colour is a var with a literal fallback, because
  the four host pages declare their palettes independently and a bare var()
  would fail silently on any page that named a token differently.

  Usage — one line, nothing else:
      {% include 'components/retirement-family.njk' %}

  The current page is detected from the page's own `slug` front matter. A page
  whose slug is not in the list renders the strip with nothing marked, which is
  the correct behaviour for the hub's own "you are here" being the strip
  itself.
-#}
<style>
.rfam { max-width: 1100px; margin: 3.2rem auto 0; padding: 0; }
.rfam-tag { font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 0.64rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--amber, #e09422); margin: 0 0 0.7rem; }
.rfam-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 0.55rem; }
.rfam-item { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.22rem; padding: 0.7rem 0.8rem; border-radius: 7px; border: 1px solid var(--border-faint, rgba(224,148,34,0.15)); background: rgba(224,148,34,0.035); text-decoration: none; transition: border-color 0.15s, background 0.15s; }
a.rfam-item:hover { border-color: rgba(224,148,34,0.34); background: rgba(224,148,34,0.08); }
.rfam-item.is-here { border-color: var(--amber, #e09422); background: rgba(224,148,34,0.1); }
.rfam-step { font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 0.62rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--amber, #e09422); }
.rfam-item.is-here .rfam-step::after { content: ' — you are here'; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: none; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-dim, #9a9080); }
.rfam-q { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 0.98rem; line-height: 1.25; color: var(--ink-bright, #f2eee8); }
.rfam-t { font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 0.72rem; line-height: 1.4; color: var(--ink-dim, #9a9080); }
.rfam-foot { font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 0.76rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--ink-dim, #9a9080); margin: 0.7rem 0 0; }
.rfam-foot a { color: var(--amber, #e09422); text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dotted rgba(224,148,34,0.4); }
.rfam-foot a:hover { border-bottom-color: var(--amber, #e09422); }
@media (max-width: 860px) { .rfam-row { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
@media (max-width: 460px) { .rfam-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
{%- set fam = [
  { slug: 'the-bitcoin-retirement',            step: 'Build',  q: 'What does my plan look like?',       t: 'One plan in full model context.' },
  { slug: 'bitcoin-escape-velocity',           step: 'Size',   q: 'How much is enough?',                t: 'The threshold your plan sits on.' },
  { slug: 'compare-retirement-plans',          step: 'Choose', q: 'Which of my options?',               t: 'Two complete plans, side by side.' },
  { slug: 'the-bitcoin-retirement-stress-test', step: 'Stress', q: 'Does it survive bad luck?',          t: 'The plan you picked, under a crash.' }
] -%}
<nav class="rfam" aria-label="The retirement decision funnel">
  <p class="rfam-tag">Four questions, in order</p>
  <div class="rfam-row">
    {%- for f in fam -%}
      {%- if f.slug == slug -%}
    <span class="rfam-item is-here" aria-current="page">
      <span class="rfam-step">{{ f.step }}</span>
      <span class="rfam-q">{{ f.q }}</span>
      <span class="rfam-t">{{ f.t }}</span>
    </span>
      {%- else -%}
    <a class="rfam-item" href="/{{ f.slug }}">
      <span class="rfam-step">{{ f.step }}</span>
      <span class="rfam-q">{{ f.q }}</span>
      <span class="rfam-t">{{ f.t }}</span>
    </a>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  </div>
  <p class="rfam-foot">Your inputs travel between these tools &mdash; the links each page offers carry the plan you are looking at, so you rarely re-type a number. {% if slug != 'bitcoin-retirement' %}<a href="/bitcoin-retirement">Start from the beginning &rarr;</a>{% endif %}</p>
</nav>
